@startuml backend-architecture

' Internal layering of the com.crewsafe Spring Boot backend: request path from
' client through the identity boundary, controllers, the deterministic safety
' policy, and persistence — plus the agent layer's draft-only relationship to
' the service layer. AWS deployment topology is covered in
' terraform-architecture.puml; this diagram is the software layering view.

title CrewSafe SG — Backend Architecture

top to bottom direction
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 155
skinparam maxMessageSize 130
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 75
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  BorderColor #2E7D32
  FontColor #1B5E20
  FontSize 17
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
  FontColor #0D47A1
  FontSize 17
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  BorderColor #EF6C00
  FontColor #E65100
  FontSize 17
}
skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor #F3E5F5
  BorderColor #7B1FA2
  FontColor #4A148C
  FontSize 17
}

actor "Client applications\nWeb SPA · Mobile · CLI" as client

cloud "Spring Security resource server\nCognito JWT validation · JWKS\nsite-scoped authz (deny-by-default)" as security

package "com.crewsafe backend" as backend {
  rectangle "REST controllers — /api/v1\nOpenAPI 3 · request validation" as controllers
  rectangle "Service layer\ndeterministic safety policy — WBGT matrix" as service
  database "Repository (Spring Data JPA)\nPostgreSQL · Flyway-owned schema" as repository
}

rectangle "ml-service (FastAPI)\nLangChain / LangGraph" as agent
cloud "Bedrock\nClaude models" as bedrock

artifact "Audit events\nevery write logged" as audit
artifact "Site + object scoping\nenforced server-side" as scoping

client --> security : Bearer JWT
security --> controllers : authorized request
controllers --> service
service --> repository : Spring Data JPA
service ..> agent : mitigation-plan request
agent --> bedrock
agent ..> service : draft proposal only\n(never auto-enacted)
service ..> audit
controllers ..> scoping

note right of security
  Constitution principle: deterministic
  safety policy wins. Never bypassed by
  the agent — proposal only, no auto-enact.
end note

note right of agent
  Draft-only. A supervisor must approve
  before a mitigation plan is enacted.
  Predicted values are visually and
  structurally distinct from observed
  or approved state.
end note

note bottom of repository
  spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto: validate
  Flyway owns the schema.
end note

legend right
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  |<#E3F2FD>| Edge / identity boundary |
  |<#E8F5E9>| Domain compute (backend + agent) |
  |<#FFF3E0>| Persistence |
  |<#F3E5F5>| Cross-cutting controls |
  --> | Request or synchronous call |
  ..> | Draft, audit, or dependency relationship |
endlegend

@enduml
